### 💡 Best Practices

* Divide complex components into smaller, more manageable pieces.
* Use functional components with hooks for easier state management and less boilerplate code.
* Avoid tightly coupled state variables by using a single state object or class.
* Use Markdown syntax for code blocks to provide better formatting and readability.
